/// The fullscreen toggle.
///
/// -160 puts it in front of the mixer at -150 and behind the day scrubber at
/// -200, which is where the rest of the interface sits. It is behind the title
/// card at -300 as well, so on the title screen it shows through that card's
/// dim rather than over it — which is correct: it is still available, just
/// part of the held-back picture like everything else there.
depth = -160;
